            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Whittle 0.1.0

- Practice with local audio and video using pitch-preserving slowdown, semitone transposition, markers, and loops.
- The Follow menu marks the selected mode. New sessions default to Page.
- Drag recordings into Whittle, search commands in the command palette, and save your practice and playlists in Whittle projects.
- Try Whittle for seven days without an account or payment method.
]]></description>
